{"id":"00038","root":"uni00038_1","name":{"ja":"水城　ゆきかぜ","en":"Mizuki Yukikaze"},"title":{"ja":"【堕落の雷撃】","en":"【Lightning Bride】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【堕落の雷撃】 水城　ゆきかぜ","en":"【Lightning Bride】 Mizuki Yukikaze"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":12,"profile":{"ja":"ノマドに捕まり、果てしない調教により変貌したゆきかぜ。普段抑えられている対魔の力を完全開放出来るようになっている。極度の戦闘にも興奮状態に入ってしまい、敵味方問わず雷で巻き込む攻撃もしばしば。ただし本人のポテンシャルの高さに身体と能力が追いつき、対魔忍の時より戦闘能力だけで言えば上昇している。  ","en":"Mizuki Yukikaze was captured by the Nomads and transformed through endless training. She can now fully unleash the anti-demon power that is usually restrained. In extreme combat she enters a state of excitement, often unleashing lightning attacks that affect both friend and foe alike. However, her body and abilities have finally caught up to her immense potential, and her combat prowess has risen even beyond what she possessed as a Taimanin."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"氷室百合","forms":[{"id":"uni00038_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[746,1492],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[127,254],"def":[80,160],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","95"]},{"id":"uni00038_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1092,2184],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[204,408],"def":[110,220],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","95","96"]},{"id":"uni00038_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1438,2877],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[281,561],"def":[140,282],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","95","96"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage"}]},"95